[01:24.60] Astral seasons drift on by
[01:28.54] In wavering delight
[01:31.95] And stretching on through time
[01:37.85] As a soul should surely be
[01:41.88] For all eternity
[01:45.23] And present in a sigh
[01:51.73] At a pace so patiently
[01:55.14] Dally there for you and me
[01:59.20] Placid all the while
[02:05.49] Ah the ticking of the clock
[02:09.07] And the ringing of the stocks
[02:13.02] Are relics of our lives
[03:41.13] Our love flows on endlessly
[03:44.53] Our love is pure and free
[03:48.72] A vast and depthless sea
[03:53.30] 